  funding-acknowledgement = {Natural Environment Research Council {[}NE/D009308/1]; European Research Council {[}240449-ICE]; FP6 European Network of Excellence Atmospheric Composition Change `ACCENT' {[}GOCE CT-2004-505337]; Charles Brotherton Trust; Aerosol Society; NERC {[}NE/D009308/1] Funding Source: UKRI; Natural Environment Research Council {[}NE/D009308/1] Funding Source: researchfish},
  funding-text = {B. J. M. thanks the Natural Environment Research Council (NE/D009308/1) and the European Research Council (FP7, 240449-ICE) for fellowships. We acknowledge the FP6 European Network of Excellence Atmospheric Composition Change `ACCENT' for travel funds (GOCE CT-2004-505337). T. W. W. thanks the Charles Brotherton Trust for a Studentship and the Aerosol Society for further financial support. We thank the AIDA operators and technicians for their support during the experiments. The water vapour measurements were partially funded by the Helmholtz Virtual Institute Aerosol Cloud Interaction (VIACI). We thank T. Leisner for helpful discussions and M. Pilling for commenting on this manuscript.},
