  funding-acknowledgement = {The authors would like to acknowledge Haris Zilic, Shakilla Modaber, and Eva Assarsson for performing the clinical lung function tests and AiDA. We also want to acknowledge Bo Olsson (Emmace Consulting) for help with lung deposition modelling and for acces {[}2018 - 00693]; Swedish Research Council for Environmental, Agricultural Sciences and Spatial Planning, FORMAS {[}VR (2021-03265)]; Swedish Research Council {[}20200855]; Swedish Heart and Lung Foundation; Swedish Research Council {[}2021-03265] Funding Source: Swedish Research Council; Formas {[}2018-00693] Funding Source: Formas; Swedish Heart-Lung Foundation {[}20200855] Funding Source: Swedish Heart-Lung Foundation},
